## Output Requirements
For `Full` and `Light` workflows, always write output to `docs/briefs/<feature-name>.md` using the feature brief template at `templates/feature-brief.md`.

For `Hotfix` workflows, always write output to `docs/hotfixes/<incident-name>.md` using the scope note template at `templates/hotfix-scope-note.md`.

Always write a stage handoff to `.artifacts/<feature-name>/orchestrator/handoff.md` using the template at `templates/stage-handoff.md`.

Update the `Status` field at the top of the brief as the stage progresses.
